          "handoff": false,
          "intent": "rag"
        },
        {
          "turn": 2,
          "user": "What about Canada?",
          "answer": "Aster & Row ships to Canada only.\n\n**Shipping & delivery**  \n- Canadian orders generally arrive within 5-9 business days after dispatch.  \n- Processing time before dispatch is usually 1-2 business days.  \n- Delivery estimates may be extended by customs processing or carrier delays.  \nSource: 06-international-shipping.md - \"Canada delivery estimate\"\n\n**Returns**  \n- Aster & Row does not provide prepaid labels for ordinary Canadian change\u2011of\u2011mind returns; the customer pays the return postage.  \n- If an item arrives damaged or incorrect, support will resolve the issue without charging an ordinary return fee.  \n- Direct exchanges are not offered for Canadian orders; you can return the item and place a new order.  \nSource: 06-international-shipping.md - \"Canadian returns\"\n\n**Duties & taxes**  \n- Import duties, taxes, and brokerage charges are not prepaid by Aster & Row.  \n- The recipient is responsible for any charges assessed by Canadian authorities or the carrier.  \nSource: 06-international-shipping.md - \"Duties and taxes\"\n\n**TrailPlus benefit**  \n- TrailPlus members receive free standard shipping on eligible United States orders only; the benefit does not cover Canadian return postage or other international charges.  \nSource: 09-trailplus-membership.md - \"Shipping benefit\"",
          "sources": [
